<%- include('../layout/header') %>

<section style="padding: 80px 0 120px;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 720px;">

    <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); letter-spacing: -0.03em; margin-bottom: 12px;">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--text-tertiary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm); line-height: 1.8;">

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you create an account, we collect:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>First and last name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Country of residence</li>
          <li>Password (stored as a bcrypt hash — we never store plain text passwords)</li>
          <li>Login timestamps and login count</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">When you use the Service, we also collect:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>Project names and Figma file IDs</li>
          <li>JSON layout data exported from your Figma designs</li>
          <li>Subscription status and payment records (via Lemon Squeezy)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li>Provide and operate the Service</li>
          <li>Authenticate your account and maintain your session</li>
          <li>Store and sync your Figma-to-Roblox project data</li>
          <li>Process payments and manage your subscription</li>
          <li>Send important account notifications (no marketing without consent)</li>
          <li>Improve the Service based on usage patterns</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Data Storage</h2>
        <p>Your data is stored on MongoDB Atlas (cloud database hosted by MongoDB Inc.) with servers located in the United States. Session data is also stored in MongoDB. We use Render.com to host the application server.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">4. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We share data only with:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Lemon Squeezy</strong> — payment processing (they handle billing securely)</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">MongoDB Atlas</strong> — database hosting</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Render.com</strong> — application hosting</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">These providers have their own privacy policies and we encourage you to review them.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">5. Cookies</h2>
        <p>We use session cookies to keep you logged in. These are strictly necessary for the Service to function and do not track you across other websites. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies. Session cookies expire after 7 days of inactivity.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul style="margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;">
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Access</strong> — request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Correction</strong> — update your account details via the profile page</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Deletion</strong> — request deletion of your account and all associated data</li>
          <li><strong style="color: var(--text-primary);">Portability</strong> — request your project data in JSON format</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">To exercise these rights, contact us through the dashboard or GitHub.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>We retain your account data for as long as your account is active. If you delete your account, we will remove your personal data within 30 days. Project data (JSON layouts) may be retained in anonymized form for service improvement.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Bloxig is a developer tool intended for users aged 13 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">9. Security</h2>
        <p>We take security seriously. Passwords are hashed using bcrypt with salt rounds of 12. API access requires JWT authentication. Sessions are stored server-side in MongoDB with HTTP-only cookies. We use HTTPS in production via Render's SSL certificates.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes via email or a dashboard notice. The "last updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--text-lg); color: var(--text-primary); letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 12px;">11. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy-related questions or data deletion requests, please contact us through the dashboard or via our GitHub repository at github.com/ethruz/bloxig.</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 32px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-faint); display: flex; gap: 16px;">
      <a href="/terms" class="btn btn--ghost">Terms of Service</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn--ghost">Back to home</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../layout/footer') %>
